WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:10.482
Last night my grandma got very sick.

2
00:00:10.483 --> 00:00:13.970
Mommy and Daddy had to go to the hospital.

3
00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:19.112
So I had to stay with Bada at night.

4
00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:22.243
Hana: Is Grandma going to be okay?

5
00:00:22.244 --> 00:00:24.330
Mom: I hope so, Hana.

6
00:00:24.331 --> 00:00:27.085
Will you be okay looking after Bada?

7
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:29.340
Hana: Yes, don't worry, Mom.

8
00:00:29.341 --> 00:00:30.721
We'll be fine.

9
00:00:30.722 --> 00:00:38.608
Dad: If anything happens, call me on my cell phone. Okay?

10
00:00:38.609 --> 00:00:41.484
Mom: We'll be back soon.

11
00:00:41.485 --> 00:00:44.113
Dad: Don't open the door for anyone!

12
00:00:44.114 --> 00:00:50.290
Hana & Bada: We won't!

13
00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:53.547
Bada: Hana! Someone is here!

14
00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:57.240
Hana: Mommy and Daddy said not to open the door.

15
00:00:57.241 --> 00:01:01.626
From outside the door: Hana! Bada! It's Minji's mom.

16
00:01:01.627 --> 00:01:03.663
Hana: Minji's mom?

17
00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:08.231
Bada: Maybe it's not Minji's mom!

18
00:01:08.232 --> 00:01:11.030
Minji's mom: Hana! Open the door!

19
00:01:11.031 --> 00:01:13.891
It's cold out here!

20
00:01:13.892 --> 00:01:17.007
Hana: It doesn't sound like Minji's mom.

21
00:01:17.008 --> 00:01:21.447
Minji's mom: Hana! Bada! Open this door right now!

22
00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:23.212
Your mom called me!

23
00:01:23.213 --> 00:01:25.309
Minji's mom: She wanted me to come over.

24
00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.847
Now, open up!

25
00:01:28.848 --> 00:01:30.955
Hana: Do you believe her?

26
00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:34.923
Bada: Let's call Dad!

27
00:01:34.924 --> 00:01:41.071
Hana: Oh! He's not answering. Oh, no!

28
00:01:41.072 --> 00:01:44.275
Bada: Hana. Let's call the police!

29
00:01:44.276 --> 00:01:47.134
Hana: Hello? Is this the police?

30
00:01:47.135 --> 00:01:49.260
My name is Hana.

31
00:01:49.261 --> 00:01:51.967
Hana: There is someone outside my house.

32
00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:58.996
Hana: And my mommy and daddy aren't home.

33
00:01:58.997 --> 00:02:01.185
Police: Hana? This is the police.

34
00:02:01.186 --> 00:02:03.284
Please open the door.

35
00:02:03.285 --> 00:02:07.943
Hana: Oh! It really was you!

36
00:02:07.944 --> 00:02:11.181
Mom: What happened! What's going on here!

37
00:02:11.182 --> 00:02:13.049
Is everything okay?

38
00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:15.110
Minji's mom: Hana wouldn't open the door.

39
00:02:15.111 --> 00:02:19.311
I told her it was me!

40
00:02:19.312 --> 00:02:24.006
Hana: But Daddy said not to open the door for anyone.

41
00:02:24.007 --> 00:02:26.116
Dad: You did the right thing, Hana.

42
00:02:26.117 --> 00:02:27.902
It's my fault.

43
00:02:27.903 --> 00:02:30.177
Hana: I'm really sorry.

44
00:02:30.178 --> 00:02:34.648
Minji's mom: No, you did the right thing.

45
00:02:34.649 --> 00:02:39.053
Mom: I should have called you, Hana, and said [n3@Minji's mom was coming.

46
00:02:39.054 --> 00:02:40.324
I'm sorry.

47
00:02:40.325 --> 00:02:42.294
Bada: How is Grandma?

48
00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:47.105
Dad: She's going to be okay.

49
00:02:47.106 --> 00:02:48.865
What a night!

50
00:02:48.866 --> 00:02:52.060
I'm glad everything turned out fine.

51
00:02:52.061 --> 00:02:57.006
My dad said it's always better to be safe than sorry.
